//! Contract tests for `{{full_name}}`.
//!
//! These tests exercise every method on the [`SubjectBackend`] trait
//! against a mocked upstream. Real credentials are never required in
//! CI; production traffic stays behind your `cargo test --ignored`
//! integration suite.
//!
//! Recommended test stack:
//!
//! - [`mockito`] for HTTP/JSON upstreams (the dependency is already
//!   wired into `Cargo.toml`).
//! - Recorded JSON fixtures under `tests/fixtures/` for cases that are
//!   easier to verify against a captured response than to mock.
//! - The official `animus-subject-mock` crate (planned, v0.4.x) for
//!   protocol-level conformance assertions once it lands.
//!
//! Replace the `placeholder` test below as soon as `backend.rs` has
//! its first real implementation.

